//! PR 7 Amendment 05 compatibility follow-up — committed legacy and mixed-format
//! public search (CF-T01–CF-T14).
//!
//! Closes **A5-T09** (pre-norms committed-index public search) and **A5-T24**
//! (mixed-format committed-index public search) using a genuine pre-`FieldNorms`
//! committed index generated by the historical `a8adf37` production writer. See
//! `tests/fixtures/index/pr07_pre_norms_v1/README.md` for provenance and hashes.
//!
//! The independent oracle tabulates analyzed field lengths and term frequencies
//! and computes BM25 with explicit arithmetic; it never calls the production
//! `compute_stats` or `bm25`.

